  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical Battle Belt is designed for ultimate comfort and functionality during tactical operations. Crafted from durable polyester with padded mesh material, this battle belt ensures a comfortable fit and breathability. The non-slip interior keeps the tactical belt securely in place, even during intense activities out in the field. 4 D-ring attachment points offer additional versatility for securing equipment. Please Note: The Rothco Battle Belt does not include an inner belt.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "2168",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical Battle Belt is designed for ultimate comfort and functionality during tactical operations. Crafted from durable polyester with padded mesh material, this battle belt ensures a comfortable fit and breathability. The non-slip interior keeps the tactical belt securely in place, even during intense activities out in the field. The duty belt features 2 rows of web loops on the outer belt, providing ample space for attaching tactical gear, pouches, and accessories. 4 D-ring attachment points offer additional versatility for securing equipment. The uniform utility belt also includes 2 openings designed for drop leg platforms or holsters, enhancing your tactical setup. Note: The Rothco Battle Belt does not include an inner belt. Perfect for law enforcement, security personnel, and outdoor enthusiasts, this battle belt is built to withstand the demands of any mission.</p>",
